{"speciesId":613,"names":{"fr":"Polarhume","es":"Cubchoo","en":"Cubchoo","ja":"クマシュン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand il est malade, sa goutte au nez dégèle et ses capacités de type Glace deviennent moins efficaces."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When it is not feeling well, its mucus gets watery and the power of its Ice-type moves decreases."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il a toujours la goutte au nez. Il l’aspire pour déclencher ses capacités. La morve en est la matière première."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its nose is always running. It sniffs the snot back up because the mucus provides the raw material for its moves."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Their snot is a barometer of health. When healthy, their snot is sticky and the power of their ice moves increases."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Their snot is a barometer of health. When healthy, their snot is sticky and the power of their ice moves increases."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il a toujours la goutte au nez. Il l’aspire pour déclencher ses capacités. La morve en est la matière première."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Siempre está con mucosidades colgando. Las aspira para hacer un movimiento, ya que son su materia prima para esto."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its nose is always running. It sniffs the snot back up because the mucus provides the raw material for its moves."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"いつも 鼻水を 垂らしている。 鼻水を すすって 技を 出す。 鼻水が 技の 素 なのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Sa roupie indique sa santé. S’il est en forme, elle sera épaisse et la puissance de ses attaques glacées augmentera."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sus mocos son su barómetro de salud. Si es buena, serán densos, y la fuerza de sus movimientos de tipo Hielo aumentará."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Their snot is a barometer of health. When healthy, their snot is sticky and the power of their ice moves increases."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"鼻水は 健康の バロメータ。 調子が いいと 粘り強くなり 氷の 技の 威力も 増す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il a toujours la goutte au nez. Il l’aspire pour déclencher ses capacités. La morve en est la matière première."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Siempre está con mucosidades colgando. Las aspira para hacer un movimiento, ya que son su materia prima para esto."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Its nose is always running. It sniffs the snot back up because the mucus provides the raw material for its moves."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"いつも 鼻水を 垂らしている。 鼻水を すすって 技を 出す。 鼻水が 技の 素 なのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sa roupie indique sa santé. S’il est en forme, elle sera épaisse et la puissance de ses attaques glacées augmentera."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sus mocos son su barómetro de salud. Si es buena, serán densos, y la fuerza de sus movimientos de tipo Hielo aumentará."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Their snot is a barometer of health. When healthy, their snot is sticky and the power of their ice moves increases."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"鼻水は 健康の バロメータ。 調子が いいと 粘り強くなり 氷の 技の 威力も 増す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Quand il est en forme, sa goutte au nez devient encore plus visqueuse. Il n’hésite pas à s’essuyer le nez sur un adversaire qui lui déplaît."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"La pegajosidad de sus mocos aumenta cuando disfruta de buena salud. Si alguien no le gusta, lo embadurna de mocos."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"When this Pokémon is in good health, its snot becomes thicker and stickier. It will smear its snot on anyone it doesn’t like."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"体調が いいと 鼻水の 粘り気が 増す。 嫌な 相手に 鼻水を ぺとりと なすりつける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"